   "fixed": "Set before any answer was collected or any E11 result seen, and not tuned. 'yes' multiplies the probability of each top-3 class the question is tied to by 3, 'no' by 0.5, and the top-3 is renormalised to the probability it had. A symptom that a document calls characteristic is stronger evidence when seen than when absent, because a photo may simply not show it, so yes is stronger than no. A question is chosen to split the top-3 probability in half; at most 2 are asked.",
